@blackgoldwing1 
False cause fallacies like Jesus being an answer for everything is really how we got into this mess. Rather than having good policies, sometimes all politicians need to do to further political support is appeal to christ to get a higher level of acceptance. Is that not concerning to you that it takes little to manipulate the masses through appealing to religion? 
The belief that there is an afterlife allows for the belief that people get further chances to live life fully even after life. You’re choosing to believe in an afterlife at the expense of giving up the only guaranteed opportunity you have, which is this present life.
